cacert.pem - Mozilla CA certificate store, in PEM format

Source:  https://curl.se/ca/cacert.pem  (extracted by curl's mk-ca-bundle.pl
         from Mozilla NSS certdata.txt; see https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html)
License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL 2.0), https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

Embedded into the kernel by kernel/arch/certs.S and used by kernel/net/x509.c
as the TLS trust anchors. To update, replace the file with a newer download
and rebuild.
